Original Ralph Philosophy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The "Ralph Wiggum technique" and the underlying methodology of running a coding
agent in a continuous, one-task-per-iteration loop with file-based shared
state was coined by:

  Geoff Huntley (https://ghuntley.com/)
  Copyright (c) Geoff Huntley

  The methodology itself is not a specific software work and is not subject
  to copyright; it is the conceptual framework that this CLI is designed to
  operationalize. Attribution is included in the README and project
  documentation in keeping with the open-source conventions of the Ralph
  community.

